<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77049" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰλύνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strew, sprinkle</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεύκ᾽ ἄλφιτα
				πολλὰ πάλυνον</span> (i.e. <i>sprinkled</i> in water,
			expld. by Sch. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμασσον, ἔφυρον</span>)
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.560
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ δ᾽ ἄλφιτα λευκὰ παλύνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.520
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				11.28
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι ἐπί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					247
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bestrew, besprinkle</i>, with dat. of the thing sprinkled, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλύνας ἀλφίτου ἀκτῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.429
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁ σῦριγξ εὐρῶτι παλύνεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					4.28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of liquids, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρην ἱδρῶτι παλῦναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.P.
					1049
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>besmear</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰξῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					10.11
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Satyr.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.1256
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>cover lightly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιὼν ἐπάλυνεν ἀρούρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νιφετῷ δ᾽ ἐπαλύνετο πάντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.69
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
